          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要刪除「%@」嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘%@’의 조건으로 %@ 계산기를 채웁니다. 지금 들어 있는 값은 사라져요." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user confirms that they want to restore a saved calculation. The argument is the name of the calculation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "‘%1$@’의 조건으로 %2$@ 계산기를 채웁니다. 지금 들어 있는 값은 사라져요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fill the %2$@ calculator with the settings from ‘%1$@’? Current values will be replaced."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fill the %2$@ calculator with the settings from ‘%1$@’? Current values will be replaced."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」の条件で%2$@計算機を設定します。現在入力されている値は消えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用“%1$@”的条件填入%2$@计算器。当前已填的值会被清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用「%1$@」的條件填入%2$@計算器。當前已填的值會被清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘규모별 수익률’ 가정이 켜져 있어요 — 자산이 클수록 연 수익률을 +0.5~1.5%p 더해 계산한 낙관 시나리오예요(Fagereng 2020·Piketty). 실제로 그 초과수익엔 더 큰 리스크가 따라요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ‘scale-based returns’ assumption is on — an optimistic scenario that adds 0.5–1.5 percentage points to the annual return as assets grow (Fagereng 2020, Piketty). In reality, that excess return comes with greater risk."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ‘scale-based returns’ assumption is on — an optimistic scenario that adds 0.5–1.5 percentage points to the annual return as assets grow (Fagereng 2020, Piketty). In reality, that excess return comes with greater risk."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「規模別リターン」の仮定がオンです。資産が大きいほど年間リターンに+0.5〜1.5ポイントを上乗せした楽観シナリオです（Fagereng 2020、Piketty）。実際には、その超過リターンにはより大きなリスクが伴います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已开启“按规模收益”假设：资产越大，年收益率额外加0.5～1.5个百分点，属于乐观情景（Fagereng 2020、Piketty）。现实中，这种超额收益伴随着更大的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已開啟「按規模收益」假設：資產越大，年報酬率額外加0.5～1.5個百分點，屬於樂觀情景（Fagereng 2020、Piketty）。現實中，這種超額收益伴隨著更大的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘기록 기반’은 여정 탭에 쌓인 기록으로 수익률을 보정한 종류예요. 기록에는 저축 입금도 섞여 있어 실제 수익률보다 높게 잡힐 수 있고, 그래서 종류별 일반값과 반반 섞어 계산합니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the 'recorded' assumption, which uses historical data to estimate returns and their standard deviation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘Record-based’ adjusts returns using the records on the Journey tab. Records also include savings deposits, so the figure can run higher than the true return — which is why it's blended 50/50 with the typical value for each type."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘Record-based’ adjusts returns using the records on the Journey tab. Records also include savings deposits, so the figure can run higher than the true return — which is why it's blended 50/50 with the typical value for each type."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「記録ベース」は、ジャーニータブに溜まった記録でリターンを補正した種類です。記録には積立の入金も含まれるため実際より高く出ることがあり、種類ごとの一般的な値と半々で混ぜて計算します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“基于记录”是用旅程页累积的记录校正收益率的类型。记录中混有储蓄存入，可能比实际收益率偏高，因此会与各类型的一般值对半混合计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「基於記錄」是用旅程頁累積的記錄校正報酬率的型別。記錄中混有儲蓄存入，可能比實際報酬率偏高，因此會與各型別的一般值對半混合計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘내보내기’로 만든 백업 파일엔 API 키가 들어가지 않아요(공유해도 안전하게). 이 백업 파일을 파일 앱·iCloud Drive에 저장하거나 메일로 보내두면 기기를 바꿔도 그대로 복원할 수 있어요. 앱은 켜질 때마다 자동으로 최근 %lld개의 백업을 기기에 보관합니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the backup and restore process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backup files made with ‘Export’ don't include your API keys, so they're safe to share. Save a backup to the Files app or iCloud Drive, or email it to yourself, and you can restore it even after switching devices. The app also keeps the latest %lld backups on your device automatically each time it opens."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backup files made with ‘Export’ don't include your API keys, so they're safe to share. Save a backup to the Files app or iCloud Drive, or email it to yourself, and you can restore it even after switching devices. The app also keeps the latest %lld backups on your device automatically each time it opens."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「書き出す」で作ったバックアップファイルにはAPIキーが含まれません（共有しても安全です）。このファイルを「ファイル」アプリやiCloud Driveに保存するかメールで送っておけば、機種変更後もそのまま復元できます。アプリは起動のたびに、直近%lld件のバックアップを自動でこのデバイスに保管します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用“导出”生成的备份文件不含API密钥（分享也安全）。把备份文件存到“文件”App、iCloud云盘，或用邮件发给自己，换设备后也能原样恢复。App每次打开时，会自动在设备上保留最近%lld份备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用「匯出」生成的備份檔案不含API金鑰（分享也安全）。把備份檔案存到「檔案」App、iCloud雲盤，或用郵件發給自己，換裝置後也能原樣還原。App每次開啟時，會自動在裝置上保留最近%lld份備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
