    "%@을 받아 연 %@로 굴리면 %@이 되지만, 그때 시급은 %@이에요. 되사면 %@, 체력 할인까지 넣으면 %@이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A comparison of the value of a given time in the future (when the time is sold) and the value of the time if it is not sold. The first argument is the string “0원” or the string “%arg원”. The second argument is the number of hours the time is worth if not sold. The third argument is the string “0원” or the string “%arg원”. The fourth argument is the string “0원” or the string “%arg원”. The fifth argument is the string “0시간”, the string “%arg시간”, or the string “%arg시간”. The sixth argument is the string “0시간”, the string “%arg시간”, or the string “%arg시간”.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@을 받아 연 %2$@로 굴리면 %3$@이 되지만, 그때 시급은 %4$@이에요. 되사면 %5$@, 체력 할인까지 넣으면 %6$@이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take %@ and grow it at %@ a year and it becomes %@ — but your hourly wage then is %@. Buying the hour back costs %@, or %@ with a stamina discount."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take %@ and grow it at %@ a year and it becomes %@ — but your hourly wage then is %@. Buying the hour back costs %@, or %@ with a stamina discount."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@を受け取って年%@で運用すると%@になりますが、そのときの時給は%@です。買い戻すと%@、体力の割引まで入れると%@です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拿到%@后按年%@投资会变成%@，但那时的时薪是%@。买回需要%@，再算上体力折扣是%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拿到%@後按年%@投資會變成%@，但那時的時薪是%@。買回需要%@，再算上體力折扣是%@。"
          }
        }
      }
