    "가장 최근 백업이 맨 위예요. 복원하면 현재 데이터가 그 시점으로 교체되고, 바로 전 상태는 ‘복원 직전 상태’로 이 목록에 남습니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the contents of the backup list.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The most recent backup is at the top. Restoring replaces current data with that point in time, and your state just before is kept in this list as ‘Before restore’."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The most recent backup is at the top. Restoring replaces current data with that point in time, and your state just before is kept in this list as ‘Before restore’."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最新のバックアップが一番上です。復元すると現在のデータがその時点に置き換わり、直前の状態は「復元直前の状態」としてこの一覧に残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近的备份在最上面。恢复后当前数据会被替换为那个时间点，恢复前的状态会以“恢复前状态”保留在此列表中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近的備份在最上面。還原後當前資料會被替換為那個時間點，還原前的狀態會以「還原前狀態」保留在此列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
