            "value" : "基本資訊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "기억나는 해의 월급만 적어도 돼요. 세전·세후 중 하나로만 통일하면 비교는 정확해요. 금액은 %@ 통화 기준이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to record past wages.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can enter just the salaries you remember. Use before-tax or after-tax consistently and the comparison stays accurate. Amounts are in %@."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can enter just the salaries you remember. Use before-tax or after-tax consistently and the comparison stays accurate. Amounts are in %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "覚えている年の給料だけでも大丈夫です。税引前か税引後のどちらかに揃えれば、比較は正確になります。金額は%@の通貨基準です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只填还记得的年份的月薪也可以。统一用税前或税后其中一种，比较就是准确的。金额按%@货币计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只填還記得的年份的月薪也可以。統一用稅前或稅後其中一種，比較就是準確的。金額按%@貨幣計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "기억나는 해의 월급을 두 개 이상 넣으면\n물가를 뺀 구매력 변화가 보여요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the effect of adding multiple salary records.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter salaries from two or more years\nto see your purchasing power after inflation."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter salaries from two or more years\nto see your purchasing power after inflation."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "覚えている年の給料を2つ以上入れると、\n物価を除いた購買力の変化がわかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填入两个或更多年份的月薪，\n就能看到扣除物价后的购买力变化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填入兩個或更多年份的月薪，\n就能看到扣除物價後的購買力變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
