    "끄면 ‘6억원’처럼 억·만 단위로, 켜면 ‘600,000,000원’처럼 숫자로만 표시합니다. 앱 전체에 적용돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the display settings section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off abbreviates large amounts in Korean units (eok = 100M, man = 10K); on shows full numbers like ‘600,000,000 won’. Applies across the whole app."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off abbreviates large amounts in Korean units (eok = 100M, man = 10K); on shows full numbers like ‘600,000,000 won’. Applies across the whole app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると「6億ウォン」のように億・万の単位で、オンにすると「600,000,000ウォン」のように数字だけで表示します。アプリ全体に適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时以“6亿韩元”这样的亿、万为单位显示；开启时只显示“600,000,000韩元”这样的数字。适用于整个App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
