    "나이·은퇴 나이·연 수익률, 은퇴 후 월 지출(희망 월수령액), 월 생활비, 세후 월급이 내 목표(여정 탭)에 저장되고 대시보드 퇴사각에 바로 반영됩니다. (현재 패시브 인컴은 보유 자산에서 자동 계산되므로 바꾸지 않아요.)" : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the user's life expectancy, retirement age, annual return, retirement savings, living expenses, and post-tax income will be reflected in the user's goals and retirement timeline.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Age, retirement age, annual return, monthly spending after retirement (desired monthly income), monthly living costs and after-tax salary are saved to My Goals (Journey tab) and reflected right away in the Dashboard quit date. (Current passive income is calculated automatically from your assets, so it isn't changed.)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Age, retirement age, annual return, monthly spending after retirement (desired monthly income), monthly living costs and after-tax salary are saved to My Goals (Journey tab) and reflected right away in the Dashboard quit date. (Current passive income is calculated automatically from your assets, so it isn't changed.)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年齢・退職年齢・年間リターン、退職後の月間支出（希望の月額受給額）、月の生活費、税引後の給料がマイ目標（ジャーニータブ）に保存され、ダッシュボードの退職日にすぐ反映されます。（現在のパッシブインカムは保有資産から自動計算されるので変わりません。）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年龄、退休年龄、年收益率、退休后月支出（期望月领取额）、月生活费、税后月薪会保存到我的目标（旅程页），并立即反映到看板的辞职日。（当前被动收入由持有资产自动计算，不会改动。）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年齡、退休年齡、年報酬率、退休後月支出（期望月領取額）、月生活費、稅後月薪會儲存到我的目標（旅程頁），並立即反映到儀表板的離職日。（當前被動收入由持有資產自動計算，不會改動。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "나이가 들수록 같은 1시간을 실제로 쓸 수 있는 몫이 줄어요. 그만큼 미래 시간을 깎아서 봐요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the value of an hour of work diminishes as you age.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The older you get, the less of the same hour you can actually use. Future time is discounted by that much."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The older you get, the less of the same hour you can actually use. Future time is discounted by that much."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年を重ねるほど、同じ1時間を実際に使える割合は減ります。その分、将来の時間を割り引いて見ます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年纪越大，同样的1小时实际能用的部分就越少。未来的时间要按这个比例打折来看。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年紀越大，同樣的1小時實際能用的部分就越少。未來的時間要按這個比例打折來看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "나이를 알아야 퇴사하는 날의 내 모습을 그릴 수 있어요. 내 목표에서 넣을 수 있어요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We need your age to picture the day you quit. Add it in My Goals."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "나이를 알아야 퇴사하는 날의 내 모습을 그릴 수 있어요. 내 목표에서 넣을 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
