    "보유 수량·투자 원금·평단은 이 내역에서 자동으로 계산됩니다(평균단가법). 평가액은 시세나 위 ‘평가액’ 칸을 따릅니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the asset's value is calculated.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quantity, cost basis and average cost are calculated automatically from this history (average cost method). Market value follows the price or the ‘Market value’ field above."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quantity, cost basis and average cost are calculated automatically from this history (average cost method). Market value follows the price or the ‘Market value’ field above."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保有数量・投資元本・平均取得単価はこの履歴から自動計算されます（平均単価法）。評価額は価格、または上の「評価額」欄に従います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持有数量、投资本金和均价会根据这些明细自动计算（平均成本法）。估值遵循行情或上方“估值”栏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持有數量、投資本金和均價會根據這些明細自動計算（平均成本法）。估值遵循行情或上方「估值」欄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
