    "성장 둔화는 시급이 오르는 속도가 해마다 얼마씩 꺾이는지예요. 8%면 올해 9%였던 성장률이 내년엔 8.3%가 돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the concept of \"decay\" in the context of time-based savings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Growth slowdown is how much the pace of wage growth fades each year. At 8%, this year's 9% growth becomes 8.3% next year."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Growth slowdown is how much the pace of wage growth fades each year. At 8%, this year's 9% growth becomes 8.3% next year."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成長の鈍化は、時給の上がるペースが毎年どれだけ落ちるかです。8%なら、今年9%だった成長率が来年は8.3%になります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增速放缓指的是时薪上涨的速度每年下降多少。如果是8%，今年9%的增速明年会变成8.3%。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增速放緩指的是時薪上漲的速度每年下降多少。如果是8%，今年9%的增速明年會變成8.3%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
