    "세후 소득은 사회보험료·누진세 근사값이에요. 나이·자산·수익률·패시브 인컴은 설정과 등록한 자산에서 처음 한 번 채워지고, 여기서 바꾸면 이 계산에만 반영됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a LifecycleSimSection.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After-tax income is an approximation of social insurance and progressive tax. Age, assets, returns and passive income are filled in once from settings and your registered assets; changes here apply to this calculation only."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After-tax income is an approximation of social insurance and progressive tax. Age, assets, returns and passive income are filled in once from settings and your registered assets; changes here apply to this calculation only."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "税引後所得は、社会保険料と累進税の概算値です。年齢・資産・リターン・パッシブインカムは、設定と登録した資産から最初に一度だけ入り、ここで変えるとこの計算にだけ反映されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "税后收入是社会保险费和累进税的近似值。年龄、资产、收益率、被动收入会先根据设置和已登记的资产填一次，在这里修改只影响这次计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "稅後收入是社會保險費和累進稅的近似值。年齡、資產、報酬率、被動收入會先根據設定和已登記的資產填一次，在這裡修改隻影響這次計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "세후 월급에서 월 지출을 뺀 값으로 월 저축을 계산해요(위 칸을 비워둔 경우). 기록 저장 시 수입·지출에 자동으로 채워집니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the net savings amount is calculated.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monthly savings are calculated as after-tax salary minus monthly spending (when the field above is blank). It's filled into income and spending automatically when you save a record."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monthly savings are calculated as after-tax salary minus monthly spending (when the field above is blank). It's filled into income and spending automatically when you save a record."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "税引後の給料から月間支出を引いた値で月間貯蓄を計算します（上の欄を空にした場合）。記録の保存時に収入・支出へ自動で入ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用税后月薪减去月支出来计算月储蓄（上方栏留空时）。保存记录时会自动填入收入和支出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用稅後月薪減去月支出來計算月儲蓄（上方欄留空時）。儲存記錄時會自動填入收入和支出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
