    "실질임금 = 명목임금 ÷ 소비자물가지수 × 100. 인상률이 그해 물가상승률보다 낮으면 실질임금은 마이너스예요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to calculate the real wage.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
