    "여정 탭 ‘내 목표’에 월 저축을 넣으면 예정된 수입으로 올해 말 자산을 예측합니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the projected year-end balance is calculated.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter monthly savings in ‘My Goals’ on the Journey tab and we project year-end assets from your scheduled income."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter monthly savings in ‘My Goals’ on the Journey tab and we project year-end assets from your scheduled income."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ジャーニータブの「マイ目標」に月間貯蓄を入れると、予定された収入で今年末の資産を予測します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在旅程页的“我的目标”中填入月储蓄，就会按预定收入预测今年年底的资产。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在旅程頁的「我的目標」中填入月儲蓄，就會按預定收入預測今年年底的資產。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "여정 탭 ▸ 내 목표(과녁 아이콘)에서 현재 나이와 목표 은퇴 나이를 넣으면, 은퇴까지 필요한 속도로 이번달·올해·5년·은퇴 목표를 단계별로 보여드려요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the feature that shows the user's",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Journey tab ▸ My Goals (target icon), enter your current age and target retirement age to see this month's, this year's, 5-year and retirement targets at the pace you need."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
