    },
    "은퇴 때 %@원 → %@원" : {
      "comment" : "A comparison of retirement savings (peak and end) between a baseline and a recommended plan. The first argument is the age at which the recommended plan ends. The second argument is the age at which the baseline ends.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "은퇴 때 %1$@원 → %2$@원"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At retirement %@ won → %@ won"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At retirement %@ won → %@ won"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退職時 %@ウォン → %@ウォン"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退休时 %@韩元 → %@韩元"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退休時 %@韓元 → %@韓元"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "은퇴 후 매달 이 금액을 쓴다면, 구체적으로 뭘 누리고 싶은가요? 그게 진짜 당신인지, 아니면 남의 사진 속 장면인지 한번 가려보세요." : {
      "comment" : "A message for the \"Bucket List\" tip.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you spend this amount each month after retirement, what exactly do you want to enjoy? Check whether that's really you, or a scene from someone else's photo."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you spend this amount each month after retirement, what exactly do you want to enjoy? Check whether that's really you, or a scene from someone else's photo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退職後に毎月この金額を使うなら、具体的に何を楽しみたいですか？ それが本当の自分なのか、他人の写真の中の光景なのか、一度見極めてみてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果退休后每月花这么多钱，具体想享受什么？分辨一下，那真的是你，还是别人照片里的场景。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果退休後每月花這麼多錢，具體想享受什麼？分辨一下，那真的是你，還是別人照片裡的場景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "은퇴 후 받고 싶은 ‘목표’ 패시브 인컴(배당·월세·이자 등)이에요. 여정 탭 ‘패시브 인컴 목표 달성률’의 기준이 됩니다. 비워두면 ‘은퇴 후 월 생활비’로 자동으로 맞춰요. 지금 실제로 받는 패시브 인컴은 자산 탭에 등록한 배당주·월세 부동산 등에서 자동 합산됩니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ‘target’ passive income (dividends, rent, interest, etc.) you want after retirement. It's the basis for ‘Passive income goal progress’ on the Journey tab. If blank, it's matched to ‘Monthly living costs after retirement’. Passive income you actually receive now is added up from dividend stocks, rental property and so on registered on the Assets tab."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
