    "은퇴 후 월 생활비 %@원의 %@ 커버 · 월 %@원 부족" : {
      "comment" : "A bar graph showing how much of the user's retirement savings will cover their monthly living expenses. The first argument is the percentage of the retirement savings that will cover the monthly living expenses. The second argument is the target monthly living expenses. The third argument is the shortfall, or the amount by which the user's savings are insufficient to cover their monthly living expenses.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
