    "음영은 수익률이 해마다 출렁일 때의 ‘가운데 50%%’ 범위예요(연 변동성 %@%% 가정). 미래는 선 하나가 아니라 이 폭 안에서 움직여요 — 시간이 갈수록 넓어지죠." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shading is the ‘middle 50%%’ range when annual returns fluctuate (assuming %@%% annual volatility). The future isn't a single line; it moves within this band — and it widens over time."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shading is the ‘middle 50%%’ range when annual returns fluctuate (assuming %@%% annual volatility). The future isn't a single line; it moves within this band — and it widens over time."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "影は、リターンが毎年上下するときの「真ん中の50%%」の範囲です（年間変動率%@%%を仮定）。未来は1本の線ではなく、この幅の中で動きます — 時間がたつほど広がります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
