    "주 투입시간엔 근무만이 아니라 출퇴근·준비·업무 생각까지 넣어야 정직한 시급이 나와요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the time-based wage calculation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For an honest hourly wage, weekly hours should include not just work but commuting, getting ready and thinking about work."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For an honest hourly wage, weekly hours should include not just work but commuting, getting ready and thinking about work."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正直な時給を出すには、週の投入時間に勤務だけでなく通勤・準備・仕事のことを考える時間まで含める必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要算出真实的时薪，每周投入时间不能只算上班，还要包括通勤、准备以及想着工作的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要算出真實的時薪，每週投入時間不能只算上班，還要包括通勤、準備以及想著工作的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "주식·코인·부동산·전세·현금 등\n보유한 자산을 목록으로 만들어 추적합니다." : {
