    "지금 시급의 %@배예요. 지금 1시간의 진짜 가격은 오늘 시급이 아니라, 그 시간이 올려 줄 미래 시급이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A comparison of the real value of a current hour of work with the value of that hour of work in the future, based on the current hourly wage and the future hourly wage. The argument is the string “%.1f”.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That's %@ times your current wage. The real price of an hour now isn't today's wage, but the future wage that hour will raise."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That's %@ times your current wage. The real price of an hour now isn't today's wage, but the future wage that hour will raise."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今の時給の%@倍です。今の1時間の本当の値段は、今日の時給ではなく、その時間が引き上げてくれる将来の時給です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
