    "지금 월급 %@은 %@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %@보다 %@ 많아요." : {
      "comment" : "A text that compares the real wage (what you can buy with your salary) from a past year to the current year. If the result is positive, it means that your salary has increased. If the result is negative, it means that your salary has decreased.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지금 월급 %1$@은 %2$@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %3$@보다 %4$@ 많아요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ more than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ more than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在の月給%1$@は、%2$@年の月給を今の物価に換算した%3$@より%4$@多いです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物价后的%3$@多%4$@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物價後的%3$@多%4$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "지금 월급 %@은 %@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %@보다 %@ 적어요. 그만큼 구매력이 깎인 셈이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A sentence that compares the real purchasing power of a current salary to that of the same salary in the past.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지금 월급 %1$@은 %2$@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %3$@보다 %4$@ 적어요. 그만큼 구매력이 깎인 셈이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ less than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@). That's how much purchasing power was lost."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ less than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@). That's how much purchasing power was lost."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在の月給%1$@は、%2$@年の月給を今の物価に換算した%3$@より%4$@少ないです。それだけ購買力が削られたことになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物价后的%3$@少%4$@。相当于购买力被削减了这么多。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物價後的%3$@少%4$@。相當於購買力被削減了這麼多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "지금 월급도 넣으면 최근 물가(%@년)까지 이어서 볼 수 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user hasn't entered their current salary.",
