    "켜면 가상 인물의 자산으로 앱을 둘러볼 수 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the toggle that allows users to view demo data.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on to explore with a sample person's assets."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "켜면 가상 인물의 자산으로 앱을 둘러볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on to explore with a sample person's assets."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、サンプルの人物の資産で見て回れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，用示例人物的资产逛一逛。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，用示例人物的資產逛一逛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "켜면 내 데이터는 안전하게 보관되고, 가상 인물(36세 직장인, 55세 은퇴 목표)의 자산·9개월 기록으로 자산·추이·계산·대시보드를 둘러볼 수 있어요. 끄면 내 데이터가 그대로 돌아옵니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the footer for the demo section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, your data is kept safe and you can explore assets, trends, calculators and the Dashboard with a fictional person's assets (a 36-year-old office worker aiming to retire at 55) and 9 months of records. When off, your data comes right back."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, your data is kept safe and you can explore assets, trends, calculators and the Dashboard with a fictional person's assets (a 36-year-old office worker aiming to retire at 55) and 9 months of records. When off, your data comes right back."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると自分のデータは安全に保管され、架空の人物（36歳の会社員、55歳で退職が目標）の資産と9か月分の記録で、資産・推移・計算・ダッシュボードを見て回れます。オフにすると自分のデータがそのまま戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，我的数据会被安全保管，你可以用虚构人物（36岁上班族，目标55岁退休）的资产和9个月的记录，浏览资产、走势、计算和看板。关闭后我的数据会原样回来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，我的資料會被安全保管，你可以用虛構人物（36歲上班族，目標55歲退休）的資產和9個月的記錄，瀏覽資產、走勢、計算和儀表板。關閉後我的資料會原樣回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "켜면 앱을 열거나 다시 돌아올 때마다 %@(또는 기기 암호)로 인증해야 자산이 보입니다. 앱을 전환할 때도 화면이 가려져요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the security settings in the settings view. The argument is the string “Face ID”, the string “Touch ID”, or the string “기기 암호”.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, you must authenticate with %@ (or your device passcode) each time you open or return to the app. The screen is also hidden when you switch apps."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, you must authenticate with %@ (or your device passcode) each time you open or return to the app. The screen is also hidden when you switch apps."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、アプリを開くとき・戻るたびに%@（またはデバイスのパスコード）で認証しないと資産が見えません。アプリを切り替えるときも画面が隠れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，每次打开或返回App都必须通过%@（或设备密码）验证才能看到资产。切换App时屏幕也会被遮住。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每次開啟或返回App都必須透過%@（或裝置密碼）驗證才能看到資產。切換App時螢幕也會被遮住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
