    },
    "파란 선은 모으는 시기, 주황 선은 쓰는 시기예요. 값을 바꾸면 바꾸기 전 곡선이 회색 점선으로 남아요." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the blue line (saving) and orange line (spending) in the graph.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The blue line is your saving years; the orange line is your spending years. When you change a value, the previous curve stays as a gray dotted line."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The blue line is your saving years; the orange line is your spending years. When you change a value, the previous curve stays as a grey dotted line."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "青い線は貯める時期、オレンジの線は使う時期です。値を変えると、変える前の曲線が灰色の点線で残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蓝线是积累期，橙线是支出期。修改数值后，修改前的曲线会以灰色虚线保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藍線是積累期，橙線是支出期。修改數值後，修改前的曲線會以灰色虛線保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "파킹·CMA는 매일 이자가 붙어 월 복리로 근사해서 계산해요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parking accounts and CMAs earn interest daily, so we approximate with monthly compounding."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parking accounts and CMAs earn interest daily, so we approximate with monthly compounding."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パーキング口座・CMAは毎日利息がつくため、月複利で近似して計算します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活期理财和CMA每天计息，所以按月复利近似计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活期理財和CMA每天計息，所以按月複利近似計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "판 종목만 골라 주세요 — 고른 것은 자산에서 지워요. 캡처를 덜 찍어서 빠진 거라면 그대로 두면 됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the \"Delete\" section of the ScreenshotImportView.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick only the holdings you sold — the ones you pick will be removed from your assets. If they're missing because you captured fewer screenshots, leave them."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick only the holdings you sold — the ones you pick will be removed from your assets. If they're missing because you captured fewer screenshots, leave them."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "売った銘柄だけを選んでください — 選んだものは資産から削除します。キャプチャの撮り足りなくて抜けているだけなら、そのままにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只选卖掉的持仓——选中的会从资产中删除。如果只是因为少截了图而缺失，请保持原样。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只選賣掉的持倉——選中的會從資產中刪除。如果只是因為少截了圖而缺失，請保持原樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "팔아서 만든 돈은 내 시간이 아니라 남의 시간을 사는 데만 쓸 것." : {
      "comment" : "A second line of the conclusion.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend money from selling only on buying other people's time, not your own."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend money from selling only on buying other people's time, not your own."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "売って作ったお金は、自分の時間ではなく他人の時間を買うためだけに使うこと。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卖出换来的钱，只用来买别人的时间，而不是自己的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "賣出換來的錢，只用來買別人的時間，而不是自己的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "팔지 않고 시급에 투자하면" : {
