    "한계 시급은 지금 1시간을 더 넣으면 실제로 더 들어오는 돈이에요. 따로 정하지 않으면 회계적 시급을 그대로 써요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the marginal wage, which is the wage you'd earn by working one more hour.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Marginal wage is the money that actually comes in if you put in one more hour now. If not set separately, your accounting wage is used."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Marginal wage is the money that actually comes in if you put in one more hour now. If not set separately, your accounting wage is used."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "限界時給は、今1時間多く入れると実際に増えるお金です。別に決めない場合は、会計上の時給をそのまま使います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边际时薪是现在多投入1小时实际能多进账的钱。不单独设定时，直接使用会计时薪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "邊際時薪是現在多投入1小時實際能多進帳的錢。不單獨設定時，直接使用會計時薪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "한동안 목표를 다시 보지 않았어요. 그동안 무엇이 달라졌나요? 계산 탭에서 만족점을 다시 한번 비춰보세요." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears after a year has passed.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You haven't looked at your goal in a while. What's changed since? Revisit your satisfaction point on the Calculate tab."
