    "허브 레코드 이름은 usage-%@ 예요. 마지막 전송이 ‘아직 없음’이면 이 기기는 한 번도 허브에 닿지 못한 거고, 원인은 대부분 iCloud 로그인입니다. 전송은 12시간에 한 번으로 제한돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A footer that describes the purpose of the section and how to find out more.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The hub record name is usage-%@. If the last send says ‘None yet’, this device has never reached the hub, and the cause is mostly iCloud sign-in. Sends are limited to once every 12 hours."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The hub record name is usage-%@. If the last send says ‘None yet’, this device has never reached the hub, and the cause is mostly iCloud sign-in. Sends are limited to once every 12 hours."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ハブのレコード名はusage-%@です。最後の送信が「まだなし」なら、このデバイスは一度もハブに届いておらず、原因はほとんどの場合iCloudのサインインです。送信は12時間に1回に制限されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "枢纽记录名为usage-%@。如果最近一次发送显示“尚无”，说明此设备从未连上枢纽，原因大多是iCloud登录。发送限制为12小时一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "樞紐記錄名為usage-%@。如果最近一次傳送顯示「尚無」，說明此裝置從未連上樞紐，原因大多是iCloud登入。傳送限制為12小時一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
